    <section class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2>The Hyderabad logistics marketing playbook</h2>
            <p class="sec-sub">The specific channel + content + funnel weights we recommend for Hyderabad operators.</p>
            <div class="grid-2">
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-shield-halved"></i></div><h3>Compliance-first content for pharma cold-chain</h3><p>Content library heavy on WHO GDP + PQS + ISO 15189 + GxP + DPCO + Schedule H compliance. Whitepapers on cold-chain audit-readiness, temperature-excursion protocols, deviation management, vaccine cold-chain best practices. This is the buyer-search behaviour for pharma cold-chain decisions.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fab fa-linkedin-in"></i></div><h3>LinkedIn ABM: Pharma supply-chain + regulatory</h3><p>150-300 named accounts across Genome Valley pharma (Dr Reddy's, Aurobindo, Divi's, Bharat Biotech, Hetero, Natco, Biological E, MSN Labs). Titles: Head of Supply Chain + Regulatory Affairs + QA + Procurement. Sales Nav + InMail cadence 6-8 touches over 12 weeks.</p></div>
                <div class="card"><div class="icon"><i class="fas fa-plane-departure"></i></div><h3>RGIA vaccine + pharma air-cargo focus</h3><p>Route-specific SEO for Hyderabad-to-GCC / EU / USA / Africa pharma + vaccine cold-chain air freight. Content on WHO-certified vaccine cold-chain air freight + pharma bulk air cargo. Speaker slots at BioAsia + India Pharma + BioSpectrum events.</p></div>
